  "summary": "The paper evaluates three quantum models (CustomQNN, HybridQNN1, HybridQNN2) for stock prediction using 3–5 qubits on a QULACS simulator. HybridQNN1 achieves the best hybrid performance (RMSE ≈ 0.0174) and HybridQNN2 ≈ 0.0192, but classical models such as LSTM achieve significantly lower error (RMSE ≈ 0.00649). All experiments are simulator-based with shallow (~10 depth) circuits and show no quantum advantage.",
